SUMMARY:Diwali at the Chapel
LOCATION:Chapel
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an enchanting evening of devotional music\, dance
 \, sacred storytelling\, and spiritual reflection as we celebrate Diwali
 \, the Hindu Festival of Lights. With special offerings from Bhajan Mand
 ali featuring Mayuri Gandharvika\, Srikar\, & Friends. Questions? [vchan
 der@princeton.edu](mailto:vchander@princeton.edu) For more information\,
  visit diwali.princeton.edu\nhttps://chapel.princeton.edu/events/diwali-
 chapel-6
URL:https://chapel.princeton.edu/events/diwali-chapel-6
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
