SUMMARY:University Chapel: An Inside Look
LOCATION:Chapel
DESCRIPTION:Tour the nearly 100-year-old Princeton University Chapel\, de
 signed by renowned Gothic Revival architect Ralph Adams Cram\, and explo
 re its rich history\, stained-glass windows\, furnishings\, and memorial
 s. Binoculars are welcome. Admission is free\, and each tour is limited 
 to 24 participants. To reserve your spot or for more information\, conta
 ct steveyacik@optonline.net\nhttps://chapel.princeton.edu/events/univers
 ity-chapel-inside-look-5
URL:https://chapel.princeton.edu/events/university-chapel-inside-look-5
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
